{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41816","headline":"书王秀才壁 · 李中","name":"书王秀才壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅舍何寥落，门庭长绿芜。\n贫来卖书劒，病起忆江湖。\n对枕暮山碧，伴吟凉月孤。\n前贤多晚达，莫叹有霜须。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}